,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Compatibility (with ANGLE fallback to D3D11) - Dedicated iGPU: Intel HD Graphics\n\n### Issue description\n\n- Wanted to use wireframes for artistic purposes in my game;\n- Implemented it by adding the `render_mode wireframe;` flag in my shader;\n- The mesh renders as expected inside the editor, but when i hit play, the mesh renders as a solid instead of a wireframe.\n\n| In Editor | In Play Mode |\n| - | - |\n| <img width=\"803\" height=\"679\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54e43e87-60f7-40c3-807c-2321a88c5788\" /> | <img width=\"800\" height=\"679\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ec680fd-74c8-42a9-b984-f8a5ee31d184\" /> |\n\nThere's a lot of things that could be going on here:\n- A bug inside the Compatibility Renderer (or a disparity between this and the other renderers);\n- A bug with my ANGLE D3D11 fallback (traditional OpenGL doesn't render anything properly on my device);\n- A bug with my iGPU (it's a cheap pc :/ i totally get it if this is an edge case);\n- Some misconfiguration on my part.\n\nIf anyone could point out anything i could do to debug this issue i would be happy to do so, i'm really lost, **this bug doesn't leave any errors in the console**.\n\nIf this behavior on the wireframe render mode is intended, i believe [the docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/spatial_shader.html) should update to reflect that.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create any mesh with a ShaderMaterial;\n- Inside the shader, write `render_mode wireframe;` anywhere.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[wireframe_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25513064/wireframe_test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"mhilbrunner","id":1654763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQ3NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1654763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner","html_url":"https://github.com/mhilbrunner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116709/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}